+children first, then at each ``+`` node flattens the whole additive subtree into a
+term list, folds remainder+quotient pairs and constants directly on that list, and
+rebuilds — no outer re-run. It must earn its OWN positive reward in a scoring run, proving the
+verifier rewards value-equivalence + node reduction, not a match against the
+oracle's code.
 """
 
 
